---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Who writes these notes, what background they come from, and why the site exists."
>
  <div class="container page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        I am a science communicator and marketing professional based in the UK, and I build things
        in my spare time.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose">
      {/* TEMPLATE: replace the [bracketed] placeholders below with your own words. */}
      <p>
        I studied astrophysics, and that background still shapes how I work: I like to know what a
        measurement means, how it was made and how far to trust it. [Add a sentence or two on your
        degree, where you studied and what you worked on.]
      </p>
      <p>
        My interests are space sustainability, climate data, Earth observation and open technology.
        I build websites, automation workflows, data systems and content platforms, and I use a
        Raspberry Pi when a small, quiet, low-power computer is the right tool for the job. [Add the
        projects, roles or organisations you want people to know about.]
      </p>

      <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
      <p>
        I started {SITE.name} to keep a public record of Raspberry Pi builds: all-sky imaging,
        environmental sensing, self-hosted infrastructure and Earth-observation experiments. Writing
        things down makes me design more carefully, and it might save someone else a weekend.
      </p>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        [Add an email address, social profile or contact form link. Corrections and suggestions are
        welcome.]
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
